@* 🟢 خطة 05 بند 23: أرصدة الأصناف بتاريخ الصلاحية (بدل ItemBalanceWithExpireFrm). سطر لكل تشغيلة بحالتها (منتهية / قريبة / سليمة / بلا تاريخ)
   نصاً ولوناً، مرتبة بالأقرب انتهاءً، مع حد «القريبة» (افتراضياً 90 يوماً) وتصفية بالمخزن والتصنيف والبحث، وذات الرصيد فقط افتراضياً، وطباعة.
   الاستعلامات فى ItemExpiryBalancesService بمعاملات. التصميم حسب ui-ux-pro-max ونظام inv-* المشترك. *@
@page "/store/balances/expiry"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Shared
@using static AccountModelsLib.ItemExpiryBalancesService
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject IJSRuntime JS
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Tr("EXTitle")</PageTitle>

<InvoiceStyles />

<style>
    .ex-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 20px; }
    .ex-head .ico { flex: none; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center;
                    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 14%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .ex-head .ico .mud-icon-root { font-size: 2rem; }
    .ex-head .titles { flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
    .ex-head .sub { margin-top: 4px; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .ex-gap { margin-top: 16px; }
    .ex-filters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 1fr) minmax(180px, 1fr) minmax(140px, .6fr) minmax(220px, 1.4fr); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
    .ex-row2 { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .ex-tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
    .ex-tile { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 14px 18px; min-height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: start; font: inherit;
               border: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); background: var(--mud-palette-surface); color: var(--mud-palette-text-primary);
               cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s, border-color .15s; }
    .ex-tile:hover { border-color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .ex-tile:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--mud-palette-primary); outline-offset: 2px; }
    .ex-tile[aria-pressed="true"] { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 10%, transparent); border-color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .ex-tile .k { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .ex-tile .v { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .ex-tile .m { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .ex-tile.s1 .v { color: var(--mud-palette-error); }
    .ex-tile.s2 .v { color: var(--mud-palette-warning-darken); }
    .ex-tile.s3 .v { color: var(--mud-palette-success-darken); }
    .ex-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ex-badge .mud-icon-root { font-size: 1rem; }
    .ex-badge.s1 { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-error) 14%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-error-darken); }
    .ex-badge.s2 { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-warning) 18%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-warning-darken); }
    .ex-badge.s3 { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-success) 14%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-success-darken); }
    .ex-badge.s4 { background: var(--mud-palette-background-gray); color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .ex-name { font-weight: 600; }
    .ex-code { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .ex-num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ex-neg { color: var(--mud-palette-error); font-weight: 700; }
    .ex-pager { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .ex-pager .info { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .ex-pager .btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .ex-empty { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 40px 12px; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); text-align: center; }
    .ex-empty .mud-icon-root { opacity: .5; }
    @@media (max-width: 1199px) { .ex-filters, .ex-tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
    @@media (max-width: 599px) { .ex-filters { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
    @@media print {
        body * { visibility: hidden; }
        .ex-print, .ex-print * { visibility: visible; }
        .ex-print { position: absolute; inset-inline-start: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; }
        .ex-noprint { display: none !important; }
    }
</style>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">
<div class="inv-page ex-print">

    <div class="inv-card ex-head">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.EventBusy" /></div>
        <div class="titles">
            <h1 class="inv-title">@Tr("EXTitle")</h1>
            <div class="sub">@Tr("EXSub", _nearDays) @(_status == ExpiryStatus.All ? "" : " — " + Tr("EXStatus_" + (int)_status))</div>
        </div>
        <MudButton Class="ex-noprint" Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Print" Disabled="_loading" OnClick="PrintAsync">@Tr("PrintButton")</MudButton>
    </div>

    <div class="inv-card ex-gap ex-noprint" role="search">
        <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.FilterList" />@Tr("SOFiltersTitle")</h2>
        <div class="ex-filters">
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_storeId" ValueChanged="OnStoreAsync" Label="@Tr("SOParty_4")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _stores.FirstOrDefault(s => s.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                @foreach (var s in _stores) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@s.Id">@s.Name</MudSelectItem> }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_categoryId" ValueChanged="OnCategoryAsync" Label="@Tr("SBCategory")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _categories.FirstOrDefault(c => c.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                @foreach (var c in _categories) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@c.Id">@c.Name</MudSelectItem> }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudNumericField T="int" Value="_nearDays" ValueChanged="OnNearDaysAsync" Label="@Tr("EXNearDays")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                             Min="1" Max="3650" Immediate="false" HelperText="@Tr("EXNearDaysHint")" />
            <MudTextField T="string" Value="_text" ValueChanged="OnTextAsync" Label="@Tr("EXSearch")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                          Immediate="true" DebounceInterval="400" Clearable="true" Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" />
        </div>
        <div class="ex-row2">
            @if (_itemId != 0)
            {
                <MudChip T="string" Color="Color.Primary" Variant="Variant.Outlined" OnClose="@(() => OnItemClearAsync())">@Tr("EXOneItem", _rows.FirstOrDefault()?.Item_Name ?? "")</MudChip>
            }
            <MudSwitch T="bool" Value="_includeZero" ValueChanged="OnIncludeZeroAsync" Color="Color.Primary" Label="@Tr("EXIncludeZero")" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-tiles ex-gap" role="group" aria-label="@Tr("EXStatusFilter")">
        @foreach (var t in Tiles)
        {
            <button type="button" class="ex-tile s@((int)t.Status)" aria-pressed="@(_status == t.Status ? "true" : "false")"
                    @onclick="@(() => OnStatusAsync(_status == t.Status ? ExpiryStatus.All : t.Status))">
                <span class="k"><MudIcon Icon="@t.Icon" Size="Size.Small" />@Tr("EXStatus_" + (int)t.Status)</span>
                <span class="v">@Count(t.Status)</span>
                @if (t.Status is ExpiryStatus.Expired or ExpiryStatus.Near) { <span class="m">@Money(t.Status == ExpiryStatus.Expired ? _sum.Expired_Value : _sum.Near_Value)</span> }
            </button>
        }
    </div>

    <div class="inv-card ex-gap">
        <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ListAlt" />@Tr("EXResults")<span class="inv-count">@_total</span></h2>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_error))
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" role="alert">@_error</MudAlert>
        }
        <MudTable Items="@_rows" T="ExpiryRow" Hover="true" Elevation="0" Class="inv-table" Breakpoint="Breakpoint.Sm" Loading="_loading" LoadingProgressColor="Color.Primary">
            <HeaderContent>
                <MudTh>@Tr("SOItem")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("SOParty_4")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("EXBatch")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("EXExpireDate")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("EXState")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("SOBalance")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("SOLineValue")</MudTh>
            </HeaderContent>
            <RowTemplate>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOItem")"><div class="ex-name">@context.Item_Name</div><div class="ex-code">@CodeText(context.Code) @context.Category_Name</div></MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOParty_4")">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(context.Store_Name) ? "—" : context.Store_Name)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("EXBatch")">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(context.Batch) ? "—" : context.Batch)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("EXExpireDate")"><span class="ex-num">@(context.Expire_Date is DateTime d ? d.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) : "—")</span></MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("EXState")">
                    <span class="ex-badge s@(context.Status)"><MudIcon Icon="@StatusIcon(context.Status)" />@StatusText(context)</span>
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOBalance")" Style="text-align:end">
                    <span class="ex-num @(context.Qty_Small < 0 ? "ex-neg" : "")">@SmallToText(context.Qty_Small, context.Factor, context.B_Unit, context.S_Unit)</span>
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOLineValue")" Style="text-align:end"><b class="ex-num">@(context.Value is decimal v ? Money(v) : "—")</b></MudTd>
            </RowTemplate>
            <NoRecordsContent>
                <div class="ex-empty">
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.EventAvailable" Size="Size.Large" />
                    <b>@Tr("EXEmpty")</b>
                    @if (!_includeZero)
                    {
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-2" OnClick="@(() => OnIncludeZeroAsync(true))">@Tr("EXIncludeZero")</MudButton>
                    }
                </div>
            </NoRecordsContent>
        </MudTable>
        @if (_total > 0)
        {
            <div class="ex-pager ex-noprint">
                <span class="info" aria-live="polite">@Tr("SOPageInfo", _skip + 1, Math.Min(_skip + PageSize, _total), _total)</span>
                <div class="btns">
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@(LangService.IsRtl ? Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronRight : Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronLeft)"
                               Disabled="@(_skip == 0 || _loading)" OnClick="@(() => PageAsync(-1))">@Tr("SOPrev")</MudButton>
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" EndIcon="@(LangService.IsRtl ? Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronLeft : Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronRight)"
                               Disabled="@(_skip + PageSize >= _total || _loading)" OnClick="@(() => PageAsync(1))">@Tr("SONext")</MudButton>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</div>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private const int PageSize = 50;
    private record Tile(ExpiryStatus Status, string Icon);
    private static readonly Tile[] Tiles =
    {
        new(ExpiryStatus.Expired, Icons.Material.Filled.Error), new(ExpiryStatus.Near, Icons.Material.Filled.Warning),
        new(ExpiryStatus.Ok, Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle), new(ExpiryStatus.NoDate, Icons.Material.Filled.HelpOutline),
    };

    /// <summary>status=1..4 يفتح على حالة، days=N حد القريبة.</summary>
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "status")] public int? StatusQuery { get; set; }
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "days")] public int? DaysQuery { get; set; }
    /// <summary>item=Id يعرض تشغيلات صنف واحد (من أرصدة الأدوية).</summary>
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "item")] public long? ItemQuery { get; set; }

    private readonly ItemExpiryBalancesService _svc = new();
    private readonly StoreBalancesService _balances = new();
    private List<StoreBalancesService.Option> _stores = new(), _categories = new();
    private List<ExpiryRow> _rows = new();
    private ExpiryRow _sum = new();
    private ExpiryStatus _status;
    private long _storeId, _categoryId, _itemId;
    private int _nearDays = 90, _skip, _total;
    private string? _text, _error;
    private bool _includeZero, _loading = true;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
        if (StatusQuery is >= 1 and <= 4) _status = (ExpiryStatus)StatusQuery.Value;
        if (DaysQuery is >= 1 and <= 3650) _nearDays = DaysQuery.Value;
        if (ItemQuery is > 0) _itemId = ItemQuery.Value;
        try
        {
            (_stores, _categories) = await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); return (_balances.GetStores(4), _balances.GetCategories()); });
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
        await LoadAsync();
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    public void Dispose() => LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;

    private async Task OnStoreAsync(long id) { _storeId = id; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnCategoryAsync(long id) { _categoryId = id; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnNearDaysAsync(int d) { _nearDays = Math.Clamp(d, 1, 3650); _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnTextAsync(string? t) { _text = t; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnIncludeZeroAsync(bool v) { _includeZero = v; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnItemClearAsync() { _itemId = 0; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnStatusAsync(ExpiryStatus s) { _status = s; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task PageAsync(int dir) { _skip = Math.Max(0, _skip + dir * PageSize); await LoadAsync(); }

    private async Task LoadAsync()
    {
        _loading = true; _error = null;
        var f = new ExpiryFilter
        {
            StoreId = _storeId, CategoryId = _categoryId, ItemId = _itemId, Text = _text, Status = _status, NearDays = _nearDays,
            IncludeZero = _includeZero, Skip = _skip, Take = PageSize,
        };
        try
        {
            _rows = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                var rows = _svc.GetBatches(f);
                // عدّادات الحالات تأتى مع الأسطر؛ إن خلت الحالة المختارة تُقرأ العدّادات بلا تصفية حالة (سطر واحد)
                _sum = rows.FirstOrDefault() ?? (f.Status == ExpiryStatus.All ? new ExpiryRow()
                       : _svc.GetBatches(new ExpiryFilter { StoreId = f.StoreId, CategoryId = f.CategoryId, ItemId = f.ItemId, Text = f.Text, NearDays = f.NearDays, IncludeZero = f.IncludeZero, Take = 1 }).FirstOrDefault() ?? new ExpiryRow());
                return rows;
            });
            _total = _rows.FirstOrDefault()?.Total_Rows ?? 0;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); _rows = new(); _total = 0; _sum = new(); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private int Count(ExpiryStatus s) => s switch
    {
        ExpiryStatus.Expired => _sum.Expired_Rows, ExpiryStatus.Near => _sum.Near_Rows, ExpiryStatus.Ok => _sum.Ok_Rows, _ => _sum.NoDate_Rows,
    };

    private static string StatusIcon(int s) => s switch
    {
        1 => Icons.Material.Filled.Error, 2 => Icons.Material.Filled.Warning, 3 => Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle, _ => Icons.Material.Filled.HelpOutline,
    };

    private string StatusText(ExpiryRow r) => r.Days_Left switch
    {
        null => Tr("EXStatus_4"),
        < 0 => Tr("EXExpiredAgo", -r.Days_Left.Value),
        0 => Tr("EXExpiresToday"),
        _ => Tr("EXDaysLeft", r.Days_Left.Value),
    };

    private async Task PrintAsync() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("window.print");

    private static string Money(decimal v) => v.ToString("N2", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
    private static string Qty(decimal v) => v.ToString("0.##", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
    private static string CodeText(string code) => string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(code) || code.Trim() == "0" ? "" : code;
    private static string SmallToText(decimal small, decimal factor, string bUnit, string sUnit)
    {
        if (factor <= 0) factor = 1;
        decimal abs = Math.Abs(small), large = Math.Floor(abs / factor), rest = abs - large * factor;
        string t = rest != 0 ? $"{Qty(large)} {bUnit} + {Qty(rest)} {sUnit}" : $"{Qty(large)} {bUnit}";
        return small < 0 ? "-" + t : t;
    }
    private static string Inner(Exception ex) { while (ex.InnerException != null) ex = ex.InnerException; return ex.Message; }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
